# Agent skills installed with `npx skills add`. They belong to the machine, not
# to the app — `.agents/` is the package, `.claude/skills/` the symlinks into
# it, and the lockfile pins the versions. Ignored because a stray `git add -A`
# otherwise sweeps a few hundred kilobytes of prose into a source commit.
